{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 9740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4830, "text": "- Hello. Remember me, Mrs. Lund?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 9740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4830, "text": "- Sure, the lady with the adoption agency."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 11700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9910, "text": "Juvenile Services Bureau."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 14140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11870, "text": "I'm the one"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 14140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11870, "text": "who had to determine Judge Stone's..."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 16470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 14310, "text": "...fitness as a potential foster parent."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 18550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16650, "text": "Leon!"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 23910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21250, "text": "Prepare to die."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 28380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25350, "text": "You know the old saying,"}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 28380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25350, "text": "\"Spare the Uzi, spoil the child.\""}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 35160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33930, "text": "- Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 35160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33930, "text": "- Yeah."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 37230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35330, "text": "Look who's here."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 39370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37400, "text": "- Hey, Mrs. Lund."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 39370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37400, "text": "- Hi."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 42000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 40940, "text": "How the hell are you?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 44300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42170, "text": "- I'm just fine, Judge Stone--"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 44300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42170, "text": "Duck, sir!"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 45530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 44470, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 56080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 54450, "text": "Gotta run. Sesame Street's on."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 59920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57520, "text": "You're dead meat, Leon!"}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 62950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60690, "text": "Sorry, Mrs. Lund,"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 62950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 60690, "text": "we were just fooling around."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 65090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63130, "text": "Tsk. Boys will be boys."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 69100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65260, "text": "Here. Have a seat, huh?"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 69100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65260, "text": "Can we get you anything, coffee, tea?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 70290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69260, "text": "Squeegee?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 74260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 72530, "text": "No, thank you."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 79030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74440, "text": "I only came by for a moment"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 79030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 74440, "text": "to tell you the good news."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 80230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79210, "text": "What's the good news?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 84440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80410, "text": "We have found adoptive parents"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 84440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 80410, "text": "for Leon."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 91350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87680, "text": "I hope you don't mind, Judge Stone,"}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 91350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87680, "text": "but I've invited the prospective parents..."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 94510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91520, "text": "...to come by tonight to meet Leon"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 94510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 91520, "text": "during your break."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 97180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 94690, "text": "Gee, that's swell."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 103100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101260, "text": "Would you excuse me? I...."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 106700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 103270, "text": "I think I'm experiencing a lip seizure."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 109970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107740, "text": "- Mac."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 109970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107740, "text": "- Right. Excuse us."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 111610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 110140, "text": "Certainly."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 114800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113740, "text": "Well..."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 119640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 116380, "text": "...I guess that leaves just you and me."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 184680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180340, "text": "Hey, hey, put a sock in it."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 184680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180340, "text": "This is a public restroom."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 190410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187720, "text": "- Now I lay me down to sleep."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 190410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 187720, "text": "- What's your problem?"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 194950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191790, "text": "Moi? Ha, ha. I have not one problem."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 194950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191790, "text": "This is a great jacket, did--?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 196320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 195120, "text": "Don't touch me."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 199230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 196790, "text": "Bad hand. Bad, bad, naughty hand."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 202630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199390, "text": "- You're crazy."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 202630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199390, "text": "- Yes, ha, ha. everybody says so."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 207830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 203200, "text": "That was very observant."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 207830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 203200, "text": "Thanks for telling me. And stay out!"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 216340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 214610, "text": "Oh, my God!"}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 218170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216510, "text": "You're Mel Tormé."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 220010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 218350, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 222110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220850, "text": "Mel Tormé."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 225710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223650, "text": "I can't believe it."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 225710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 223650, "text": "I don't know what to say."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 228050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225890, "text": "- Oh, you're a fan?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 228050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225890, "text": "- Who, me?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 229920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 228220, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 231920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 230090, "text": "But, oh, my judge is, the--"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 236960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233260, "text": "My God. If I can introduce you two,"}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 236960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 233260, "text": "it will be the suck-up coup of the century."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 238600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 237130, "text": "Harry would love me forever."}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 240900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238770, "text": "Oh, wait, no, please."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 240900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 238770, "text": "Allow me to do that."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 244840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243570, "text": "Prevents chafing."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 254180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249980, "text": "Well, as fun as this has been..."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 257180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254350, "text": "...you'll have to excuse me."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 261110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 260090, "text": "Wait."}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 265290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262390, "text": "Oh, wait, please, please."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 265290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262390, "text": "Don't go. Don't go, I need you."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 267550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265460, "text": "Oh, that is wonderful material."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 273130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269230, "text": "Look, I'd love to meet your friend, okay?"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 273130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 269230, "text": "But I've had some things stolen."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 276000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273300, "text": "I gotta be in front of Judge Klein"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 276000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 273300, "text": "in about 20 minutes."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 278470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 276170, "text": "No, wait, please, you don't understand."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 281270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279540, "text": "Harry worships you."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 284280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281440, "text": "Just tell me where you're gonna be,"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 284280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281440, "text": "I'll bring him to you."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 286140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 284450, "text": "Move."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 289220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287320, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 291590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 289680, "text": "Hey, in the cafeteria. Great."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 294850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291750, "text": "Mel, you're beautiful, I love you."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 294850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 291750, "text": "Never change."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 298890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295360, "text": "Don't let the geek in the penguin suit"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 298890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 295360, "text": "out of your sight."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 309330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306840, "text": "Let me rephrase that."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 320810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319110, "text": "Yeah?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 327560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325650, "text": "What can I do for you, Miss Sullivan?"}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 333290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330260, "text": "Are we ever going to see you"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 333290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330260, "text": "laugh again, sir?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 335900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333930, "text": "I don't think it's anything physiological."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 338730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336060, "text": "I think I just got"}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 338730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 336060, "text": "the good old-fashioned blues."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 342470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339300, "text": "Well, you knew"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 342470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 339300, "text": "Leon was gonna be adopted someday."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 347580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342640, "text": "Yeah, I knew it,"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 347580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 342640, "text": "but why the hell did it have to be so quick?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 350940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347740, "text": "The kid's been up for grabs for 12 years."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 353410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351110, "text": "Then I get him,"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 353410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351110, "text": "and three weeks later, boom..."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 356140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353580, "text": "...it's Mr. and Mrs. Mommy-and-Daddy."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 359250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357150, "text": "Wasn't that"}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 359250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 357150, "text": "what we were all hoping for, sir?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 364880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361860, "text": "Yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 364880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361860, "text": "It's what we were all hoping for."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 368990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 366760, "text": "Ready to start, fool!"}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 378470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 376640, "text": "Thank you, Bull."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 383310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380380, "text": "I knew I should have gone"}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 383310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380380, "text": "with Tina Turner."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 390620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 389280, "text": "Sir...."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 394750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390790, "text": "I'd rather be alone right now,"}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 394750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390790, "text": "if you don't mind, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 397120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394920, "text": "Yeah, I understand."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 404430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402160, "text": "Coochy-coochy-coochy coo."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 410310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 406870, "text": "Then if there will be nothing else, sir."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 415280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 413880, "text": "Hey."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 417610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415440, "text": "- Excuse me, Mr. Tormé."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 417610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415440, "text": "Mm-hm."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 420980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417780, "text": "I hate to be a bother,"}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 420980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417780, "text": "but this would really mean a lot to me..."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 424180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421150, "text": "- ...because I'm such a big fan."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 424180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421150, "text": "- Oh, well, what can I do for you?"}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 426550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 424350, "text": "Do you know Prince?"}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 431680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429160, "text": "- No."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 431680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 429160, "text": "- Forget it."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 449940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448110, "text": "Oh, I was just coming out to get you, sir."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 451840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450110, "text": "- Just waiting to get a drink, Mac."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 451840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450110, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 455580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452010, "text": "Wouldn't you know, it's one of those jerks"}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 455580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452010, "text": "who hogs the thing now and forever."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 456840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 455750, "text": "Uh-huh."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 459390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457020, "text": "- I mean that."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 459390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457020, "text": "- That's right."}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 461220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459550, "text": "Leave any for me?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 463920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 461390, "text": "Yeah, same to you, bozo."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 469390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465730, "text": "- Oh, look at that. He slobbered all over it."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 469390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465730, "text": "Ew."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 473530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470930, "text": "A $50 fine and suspended sentence."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 477330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473700, "text": "And, Mr. and Mrs. Solomon,"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 477330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473700, "text": "for your own protection..."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 482070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477510, "text": "...try to stay away from the stables"}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 482070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 477510, "text": "in Central Park during mating season."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 484180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 482740, "text": "Bull."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 486140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 485010, "text": "Hey, Harry."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 489110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486310, "text": "- Hey, Leon."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 489110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486310, "text": "- I was, uh, wondering if I could have..."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 492150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489280, "text": "- ...a couple bucks to go to the movies."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 492150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489280, "text": "- Sure. What's playing?"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 495260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 492320, "text": "Massacre at Hacksaw High"}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 495260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 492320, "text": "and I Dismember Mama."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 497150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496120, "text": "Whoa."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 500120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497330, "text": "There's gotta be something in here"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 500120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497330, "text": "suitable for kids."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 502560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 500300, "text": "Here you go. Bambi."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 505400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 503060, "text": "\"Goddess of Lust.\""}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 507930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506770, "text": "Psst."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 510660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508100, "text": "Tell him."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 515370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 513540, "text": "Leon, uh..."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 517680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 516210, "text": "...I gotta tell you something."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 519770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 518650, "text": "Yes?"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 523910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520850, "text": "Leon, you got...."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 530020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525920, "text": "You got a beautiful pair of eyes,"}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 530020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525920, "text": "did you know that?"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 532690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530790, "text": "Yeah, thanks."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 533920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 532860, "text": "They were a set."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 536320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 535300, "text": "They were a set!"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 539800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538100, "text": "Is he precious or what?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 544740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541970, "text": "Okay, he's no Richard Pryor, but...."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 550910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547480, "text": "Leon, I have to talk to you."}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 550910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 547480, "text": "You wait in my office. We'll have dinner."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 552780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551080, "text": "Sure, Harry."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 557010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553750, "text": "- Oh, can I play with your dead armadillo?"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 557010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 553750, "text": "- Oh, yeah, have a ball."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 558650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557190, "text": "Thank you."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 566460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563990, "text": "Okay, that's time"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 566460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 563990, "text": "to strap on the feedbags, folks."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 569000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 566630, "text": "We'll take an hour, huh?"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 570760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 569160, "text": "Sir."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 574230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570930, "text": "Yeah, yeah, I'm-- I'm gonna go tell him."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 577430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574400, "text": "- You know, he likes you a lot better than--"}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 577430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574400, "text": "- Now."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 579870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 578170, "text": "Yes, ma'am."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 588380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584650, "text": "- You know, if I'd had time to prepare--"}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 588380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584650, "text": "Hey, Harry."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 592210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590990, "text": "What is it, Bull?"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 595250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 593660, "text": "Never mind."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 609000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 607140, "text": "Forget it, Mac."}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 611700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609170, "text": "Nothing will cheer him up today."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 619580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617310, "text": "Do you want me to open that for you?"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 621940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 619750, "text": "No, no, I can handle it."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 626150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624520, "text": "It's stuck."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 631420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626690, "text": "- Sir, you have to be strong for Leon's sake."}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 631420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 626690, "text": "- You got any suggestions?"}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 632750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631590, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 635450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 632930, "text": "Put on a happy face."}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 644570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 641800, "text": "You carry those things around with you?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 649370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 645210, "text": "Yes, just for emergencies like this."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 651880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650550, "text": "There."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 656250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654880, "text": "Well?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 659780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 657290, "text": "Gee, I feel better already."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 662480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659950, "text": "Go get him, tiger."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 665520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663190, "text": "Have a nice day."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 673100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 671370, "text": "Hey, Leon, guess what."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 676760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674700, "text": "I'm way ahead of you, bro."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 688920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685010, "text": "Mr. and Mrs. Johnson,"}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 688920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685010, "text": "I'd like you to meet Judge Stone."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 690480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689080, "text": "- Hello."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 690480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689080, "text": "- Hi."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 692210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 690650, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 702260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698830, "text": "Leon, I was gonna tell you, I swear, buddy,"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 702260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698830, "text": "but I never had a chance."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 704460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703130, "text": "They're nerds."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 709400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 707640, "text": "Leon, you just met them."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 711540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 709570, "text": "Watch this."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 715070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713370, "text": "- Uh, sir?"}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 715070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 713370, "text": "- Mr. Johnson."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 717140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 715240, "text": "Give me five."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 719870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717310, "text": "Well, I don't see why not."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 725340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722320, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 731260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727460, "text": "- Have I made a faux pas? Ha, ha."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 731260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 727460, "text": "- Say what, Jack?"}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 733400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731430, "text": "- Who's Jack?"}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 733400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731430, "text": "- Dudley."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 734790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733560, "text": "- Who's Dudley?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 734790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733560, "text": "- I am."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 737360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734960, "text": "I don't wanna hear no more of this."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 741930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 737930, "text": "Mr. Johnson is in raw sewage."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 746330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742670, "text": "I'm the director of one of the largest"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 746330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742670, "text": "treatment facilities in the tristate area."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 748740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746510, "text": "You're being modest, Dudley."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 751140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 748910, "text": "This man is personally responsible..."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 755840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751310, "text": "...for over 4 million tons"}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 755840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 751310, "text": "of raw sewage a day."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 759240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756720, "text": "What the heck you been feeding him?"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 768190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763360, "text": "No, no, no, Leon. I coordinate operations"}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 768190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763360, "text": "for treatment and disposal."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 772260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768560, "text": "- Oh, you mean you shovel--?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 772260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 768560, "text": "- Hey, hey, hey."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 775000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 773130, "text": "Leon tell you he much he loves baseball?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 776760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775170, "text": "- Tell him, Leon."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 776760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 775170, "text": "- I like baseball--"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 778410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 776940, "text": "See, what did I tell you, huh?"}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 781270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778570, "text": "Great, we can drop by"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 781270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778570, "text": "the sporting-goods store..."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 783240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781440, "text": "...and pick up a bat and a puck."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 788120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786180, "text": "Uh, that's a bat and a ball."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 789480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 788280, "text": "Oh, ha! Dear me."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 797120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 793120, "text": "Oh, I just hate to break up all this fun..."}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 799960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797290, "text": "...but we really should be going."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 804490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800960, "text": "Mrs. Lund, how long will Leon"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 804490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800960, "text": "be staying with me?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 808300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804930, "text": "Oh, no, Judge Stone,"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 808300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 804930, "text": "I'm afraid you don't understand."}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 810500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 808470, "text": "Leon is coming with us."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 813340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811940, "text": "You mean that's it?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 816310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813510, "text": "- He gets adopted just like that?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 816310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 813510, "text": "- Oh, no, no, no."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 821420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816480, "text": "First, there'll be family encounter sessions,"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 821420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816480, "text": "support groups, weekend visits."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 824850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821580, "text": "But in the meantime,"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 824850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821580, "text": "Leon will be living at the shelter."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 829010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825020, "text": "From our experience, we've found"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 829010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825020, "text": "that it makes for an easier transition."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 832480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830960, "text": "Well..."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 834720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832960, "text": "...time to go."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 837290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836230, "text": "Harry."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 844940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843000, "text": "Knock them dead, Leon."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 847800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845110, "text": "Show them what a great son is like."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 857350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855880, "text": "Mom."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 859690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 858220, "text": "Dad."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 862490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860660, "text": "I'm ready to go."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 869900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868030, "text": "Did you know, Leon,"}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 869900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 868030, "text": "the ancient Romans..."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 873060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870060, "text": "...built the first modern"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 873060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 870060, "text": "sewage-transportation system?"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 878610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873230, "text": "Dudley wrote an article about it."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 878610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873230, "text": "\"The Flush Heard Round the World.\""}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 885840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881740, "text": "Judge Stone,"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 885840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881740, "text": "sometimes it's easier this way."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 892780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890520, "text": "Oh, yeah, that was a breeze."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 906570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904200, "text": "Speak to me, Mel."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 912170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 910340, "text": "I need you."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 916670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 914640, "text": "I need somebody."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 926050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922480, "text": "Excuse me, I need somebody."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 926050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 922480, "text": "I got this two lunatics chasing me--"}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 928380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 927190, "text": "Hello?"}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 929960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 928560, "text": "Hello?"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 933490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930930, "text": "Everybody here is nuts."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 936460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 934700, "text": "Yes?"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 940860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937730, "text": "Excuse me,"}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 940860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937730, "text": "I didn't think you heard me, I--"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 943730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942100, "text": "Never mind."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 947030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 944910, "text": "I said, yes?"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 951710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948080, "text": "Oh, for Pete's sake, some people."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 954510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952080, "text": "If you need something,"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 954510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 952080, "text": "why don't you just...?"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 958150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956350, "text": "Coming."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 963590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961320, "text": "- Yeah?"}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 963590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961320, "text": "- Your Honor, Leon's gone."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 966280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963760, "text": "- Call me back."}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 966280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963760, "text": "- He ran from Mrs. Lund and that couple."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 968360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 966460, "text": "I knew that was gonna happen."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 969830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 968530, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 971060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 970000, "text": "Excuse me, I didn't mean--"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 976230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974700, "text": "Hello?"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 977960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976400, "text": "- Mel."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 977960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976400, "text": "- That way."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 979800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978140, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 984510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982110, "text": "Look, you're gonna have to"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 984510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982110, "text": "call him back."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 992490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 991020, "text": "Huh."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1003920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1000460, "text": "Don't ever change."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1007070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005200, "text": "I mean it."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1014670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012340, "text": "- Any sign of Harry?"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1014670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012340, "text": "- Not yet."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1018710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015410, "text": "Mac, I'm so worried."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1018710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015410, "text": "Nobody's heard from him since yesterday."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1022410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018880, "text": "As long as that kid's missing,"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1022410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018880, "text": "Harry will search for him till he drops."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1033220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030220, "text": "Found him outside on the steps."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1033220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1030220, "text": "He almost made it to the door."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1037600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034230, "text": "- How long you think he was laying there?"}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1037600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1034230, "text": "- I don't know."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1040290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037770, "text": "But these footprints look fresh."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1055770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1054280, "text": "You may be seated."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1064780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060820, "text": "- Sir."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1064780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060820, "text": "- Ugly-looking bunch, huh, Mac?"}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1068690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064960, "text": "- Sir, I canceled the session."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1068690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064960, "text": "- Oh."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1072100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068860, "text": "Sir, why don't you go back in your office,"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1072100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068860, "text": "get a little more sleep?"}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1075930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072270, "text": "- The police will call if they find him."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1075930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072270, "text": "- I can't sleep, Mac."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1080300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076100, "text": "I keep having this dream of people"}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1080300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076100, "text": "walking all over me."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1086040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084010, "text": "Wanna talk about it?"}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1089850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088550, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1095420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093520, "text": "Take it easy, sir."}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1103990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102730, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1106660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104170, "text": "Step over me."}
{"cue": 350, "end_ms": 1110100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108140, "text": "Come on."}
{"cue": 351, "end_ms": 1114200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112610, "text": "Hi, Harry."}
{"cue": 352, "end_ms": 1119600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117580, "text": "You look like raw sewage."}
{"cue": 353, "end_ms": 1122510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121350, "text": "Leon."}
{"cue": 354, "end_ms": 1126850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122950, "text": "Don't come any closer."}
{"cue": 355, "end_ms": 1126850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122950, "text": "If you do, I'll take off again."}
{"cue": 356, "end_ms": 1128780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127590, "text": "Where you been, Leon?"}
{"cue": 357, "end_ms": 1131320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129660, "text": "Here and there."}
{"cue": 358, "end_ms": 1133730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1131790, "text": "You don't have to worry about me."}
{"cue": 359, "end_ms": 1136220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134200, "text": "I do worry about you, Leon."}
{"cue": 360, "end_ms": 1138370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136400, "text": "You know I worry about you."}
{"cue": 361, "end_ms": 1140670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138800, "text": "Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 362, "end_ms": 1144900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141500, "text": "I heard through the grapevine"}
{"cue": 363, "end_ms": 1144900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1141500, "text": "you were looking for me last night."}
{"cue": 364, "end_ms": 1148910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145070, "text": "What are you, crazy,"}
{"cue": 365, "end_ms": 1148910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145070, "text": "walking around these streets by yourself?"}
{"cue": 366, "end_ms": 1154100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150650, "text": "Why don't you come on in, huh?"}
{"cue": 367, "end_ms": 1154100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150650, "text": "We'll have a bite. Maybe we could talk."}
{"cue": 368, "end_ms": 1156820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155380, "text": "Don't come any closer."}
{"cue": 369, "end_ms": 1160220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156980, "text": "You know once I get out this door,"}
{"cue": 370, "end_ms": 1160220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1156980, "text": "you'll never be able to catch me."}
{"cue": 371, "end_ms": 1162080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160860, "text": "Yeah, I know."}
{"cue": 372, "end_ms": 1167420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165390, "text": "I just came by to tell you...."}
{"cue": 373, "end_ms": 1174160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170060, "text": "To tell you thanks"}
{"cue": 374, "end_ms": 1174160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1170060, "text": "for letting me crash with you for a while..."}
{"cue": 375, "end_ms": 1177260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1174700, "text": "...and not to get discouraged"}
{"cue": 376, "end_ms": 1177260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1174700, "text": "because there's nothing..."}
{"cue": 377, "end_ms": 1179740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177440, "text": "...you people can do"}
{"cue": 378, "end_ms": 1179740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1177440, "text": "with somebody like me."}
{"cue": 379, "end_ms": 1181770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179910, "text": "You're wrong, Leon."}
{"cue": 380, "end_ms": 1183910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181940, "text": "There is stuff we can do for you."}
{"cue": 381, "end_ms": 1186840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184080, "text": "- Like?"}
{"cue": 382, "end_ms": 1186840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1184080, "text": "- Like we got you parents, right?"}
{"cue": 383, "end_ms": 1189310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187010, "text": "A bat and a puck?"}
{"cue": 384, "end_ms": 1194750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192320, "text": "Okay, so they're geeks."}
{"cue": 385, "end_ms": 1199550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196890, "text": "But they're nice geeks."}
{"cue": 386, "end_ms": 1202720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199730, "text": "Maybe with a little care,"}
{"cue": 387, "end_ms": 1202720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199730, "text": "a little understanding from you..."}
{"cue": 388, "end_ms": 1205420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202900, "text": "...they would have turned out fine."}
{"cue": 389, "end_ms": 1208000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205600, "text": "They wanted to try, Leon."}
{"cue": 390, "end_ms": 1210200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1208170, "text": "You never gave them a chance."}
{"cue": 391, "end_ms": 1214070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211070, "text": "I guess that's why"}
{"cue": 392, "end_ms": 1214070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1211070, "text": "they call me incorrugated."}
{"cue": 393, "end_ms": 1216680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1215280, "text": "Incorrigible."}
{"cue": 394, "end_ms": 1218810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216840, "text": "- That's the word."}
{"cue": 395, "end_ms": 1218810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216840, "text": "- Yeah."}
{"cue": 396, "end_ms": 1221710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219380, "text": "I don't think you're incorrigible, Leon."}
{"cue": 397, "end_ms": 1223410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222150, "text": "Harry."}
{"cue": 398, "end_ms": 1227650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223580, "text": "- You got a lot to learn. I gotta go."}
{"cue": 399, "end_ms": 1227650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223580, "text": "- Where are you gonna go?"}
{"cue": 400, "end_ms": 1230950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229290, "text": "California."}
{"cue": 401, "end_ms": 1232890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231130, "text": "L.A."}
{"cue": 402, "end_ms": 1235150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1233060, "text": "Maybe I can get a series."}
{"cue": 403, "end_ms": 1239990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236360, "text": "Gary Coleman must be getting pretty close"}
{"cue": 404, "end_ms": 1239990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236360, "text": "to retirement by now."}
{"cue": 405, "end_ms": 1241930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240170, "text": "Don't go."}
{"cue": 406, "end_ms": 1244170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242400, "text": "We will work something out."}
{"cue": 407, "end_ms": 1245810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1244340, "text": "There's nothing to work out."}
{"cue": 408, "end_ms": 1249670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245970, "text": "Yeah, there is something to work out."}
{"cue": 409, "end_ms": 1249670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245970, "text": "It's what you want and you know it."}
{"cue": 410, "end_ms": 1251710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249840, "text": "- Says who?"}
{"cue": 411, "end_ms": 1251710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1249840, "text": "- Says me."}
{"cue": 412, "end_ms": 1255110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251880, "text": "You came back, right?"}
{"cue": 413, "end_ms": 1255110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251880, "text": "So you must have had a reason."}
{"cue": 414, "end_ms": 1257250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1255280, "text": "Yeah, I had a reason."}
{"cue": 415, "end_ms": 1262820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260990, "text": "But it's stupid."}
{"cue": 416, "end_ms": 1266320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265060, "text": "Tell me."}
{"cue": 417, "end_ms": 1268420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1266830, "text": "I thought...."}
{"cue": 418, "end_ms": 1273400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270100, "text": "I thought"}
{"cue": 419, "end_ms": 1273400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1270100, "text": "maybe I could keep staying with you."}
{"cue": 420, "end_ms": 1276530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1275500, "text": "Leon."}
{"cue": 421, "end_ms": 1278700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276700, "text": "- Told you it was stupid."}
{"cue": 422, "end_ms": 1278700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276700, "text": "- It's not stupid."}
{"cue": 423, "end_ms": 1281870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279470, "text": "- Isn't it?"}
{"cue": 424, "end_ms": 1281870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1279470, "text": "- No."}
{"cue": 425, "end_ms": 1288110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286350, "text": "But it's not...."}
{"cue": 426, "end_ms": 1291920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288980, "text": "It's not what's best for you."}
{"cue": 427, "end_ms": 1295820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292090, "text": "What's best for you is a family"}
{"cue": 428, "end_ms": 1295820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292090, "text": "that's got a father and a mother..."}
{"cue": 429, "end_ms": 1298080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295990, "text": "...and that's something"}
{"cue": 430, "end_ms": 1298080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295990, "text": "I can't offer to you."}
{"cue": 431, "end_ms": 1301530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298260, "text": "And I don't know"}
{"cue": 432, "end_ms": 1301530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298260, "text": "if I'll ever be able to offer you that."}
{"cue": 433, "end_ms": 1304360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1302260, "text": "But I did hope..."}
{"cue": 434, "end_ms": 1309330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306970, "text": "...that we'd always be friends."}
{"cue": 435, "end_ms": 1314870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311810, "text": "I wish you could have"}
{"cue": 436, "end_ms": 1314870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311810, "text": "always been my father."}
{"cue": 437, "end_ms": 1319540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1317310, "text": "Leon. Leon!"}
{"cue": 438, "end_ms": 1321650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319710, "text": "Leon!"}
